WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.610
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:02.880 --> 00:04.920
So it was planned all along.

3
00:29.600 --> 00:31.120
I really can't take this anymore

4
00:31.280 --> 00:32.439
I've told so many lies.

5
00:32.440 --> 00:33.560
I'm afraid karma will come for me.

6
00:35.280 --> 00:36.400
It won't.

7
00:37.440 --> 00:38.880
If karma comes for anyone,

8
00:39.000 --> 00:40.000
it'll be me.

9
00:40.440 --> 00:41.840
It won't touch you.

10
00:43.800 --> 00:45.240
Thank you for helping me.

11
00:47.160 --> 00:49.000
There was a jigsaw puzzle in the back.

12
00:49.240 --> 00:50.559
Something felt off about it

13
00:50.560 --> 00:51.680
so I didn't bring it up.

14
00:51.920 --> 00:52.920
See for yourself.

15
00:57.800 --> 00:59.720
You were right not to bring it up.

16
01:00.360 --> 01:01.360
Find somewhere

17
01:01.800 --> 01:02.880
and hide it.

18
01:06.053 --> 01:07.053
Okay.

19
02:50.080 --> 02:51.280
Son.

20
02:55.800 --> 02:56.920
Son?

21
03:02.720 --> 03:03.880
Feiyu?

22
03:07.920 --> 03:09.280
Xu Feiyu?

23
03:17.840 --> 03:19.160
Xu Feiyu?

24
03:33.840 --> 03:34.840
Feiyu.

25
03:35.800 --> 03:36.400
Feiyu!

26
03:36.401 --> 03:37.920
What are you doing?

27
03:38.320 --> 03:39.160
Feiyu!

28
03:39.161 --> 03:40.280
What are you doing!

29
03:40.360 --> 03:41.360
Feiyu.

30
03:41.680 --> 03:43.680
Stop scratching! Feiyu.

31
03:44.640 --> 03:46.959
What's wrong? What's wrong?

32
03:46.960 --> 03:47.440
Ah.

33
03:47.440 --> 03:48.440
Feiyu.

34
03:48.640 --> 03:49.160
Feiyu.

35
03:49.161 --> 03:51.119
Stop scratching, stop scratching.

36
03:51.120 --> 03:53.120
Mom's right here.

37
03:53.240 --> 03:54.399
Look at Mom.

38
03:54.400 --> 03:55.600
Look at Mom.

39
03:56.120 --> 03:57.240
What's in your mouth?

40
03:57.600 --> 03:58.879
What's in your mouth!

41
03:58.880 --> 03:59.959
Ah! Spit it out!

42
03:59.960 --> 04:01.920
Feiyu, spit it out!

43
04:02.480 --> 04:03.560
Spit it out.

44
04:06.600 --> 04:07.600
Feiyu.

45
04:08.520 --> 04:09.520
What is it?

46
04:10.440 --> 04:11.160
Feiyu.

47
04:11.320 --> 04:12.320
What's wrong?

48
04:13.440 --> 04:15.160
So many rats.

49
04:15.280 --> 04:16.280
What?

50
04:16.320 --> 04:18.159
So many… rats.

51
04:18.160 --> 04:19.160
Rats.

52
04:21.520 --> 04:23.680
Rats? There are no rats.

53
04:24.643 --> 04:25.136
Feiyu...

54
04:28.340 --> 04:29.400
No rats.

55
04:29.401 --> 04:30.480
There are no rats.

56
04:32.760 --> 04:33.480
Mom's here.

57
05:03.526 --> 05:06.640
He... had an allergic reaction

58
05:06.960 --> 05:08.400
but he's all right now.

59
05:14.000 --> 05:15.680
You should go back and rest.

60
05:33.480 --> 05:34.480
Yong Qi.

61
05:36.480 --> 05:37.480
Tell me.

62
05:38.800 --> 05:40.640
Did I do the wrong thing again?

63
05:43.120 --> 05:44.480
Are you backing out?

64
05:45.920 --> 05:47.600
If you back out now

65
05:48.880 --> 05:51.120
then all Feiyu suffered was for nothing.

66
05:56.080 --> 05:57.160
I'm not backing out.

67
05:59.520 --> 06:00.920
It's just that...

68
06:02.400 --> 06:04.040
Feiyu doesn't deserve this.

69
06:11.280 --> 06:13.160
Let's leave things alone for now.

70
06:14.280 --> 06:16.360
I'm scared that if something else happens...

71
06:18.120 --> 06:20.200
I don't even know if Feiyu could take it.

72
06:25.440 --> 06:26.440
Mm…

73
07:06.800 --> 07:08.000
You're awake?

74
07:09.040 --> 07:10.040
Let me do that.

75
07:26.080 --> 07:27.040
Slow down

76
07:27.041 --> 07:28.200
don't choke.

77
07:34.040 --> 07:35.040
Are you hungry?

78
07:38.240 --> 07:39.240
No.

79
07:40.886 --> 07:41.880
So...

80
07:42.640 --> 07:43.720
feeling any better?

81
07:46.800 --> 07:48.280
Much better.

82
08:15.680 --> 08:17.800
Song Yi had vanished from the world.

83
08:19.160 --> 08:20.320
In those nine months,

84
08:20.773 --> 08:23.679
I'd almost finished my first manga series,

85
08:24.213 --> 08:26.413
"The Animals' First Glance."

86
08:26.800 --> 08:28.280
Ah, no. Wait.

87
08:29.640 --> 08:31.080
I didn't finish it alone.

88
08:31.713 --> 08:38.873
The two of us finished this manga story, even though he wasn't with me.

89
08:39.320 --> 08:40.880
But he's right here in my book,

90
08:42.240 --> 08:43.840
always before my eyes.

91
09:15.120 --> 09:17.120
Still no word from Feiyu?

92
09:18.400 --> 09:19.360
No.

93
09:19.361 --> 09:20.800
I'm used to it by now.

94
09:22.480 --> 09:24.560
You haven't tried reaching out to him?

95
09:26.040 --> 09:26.480
Ah.

96
09:26.480 --> 09:27.480
Never mind.

97
09:28.240 --> 09:30.199
He never says it out loud

98
09:30.200 --> 09:31.200
but I know

99
09:31.920 --> 09:33.080
deep down he hates me.

100
09:34.480 --> 09:36.480
It's been so long now.

101
09:37.240 --> 09:38.560
Maybe it's time to move on.

102
09:40.600 --> 09:41.880
You think so?

103
09:42.360 --> 09:43.519
After all this time

104
09:43.520 --> 09:45.200
I can't even get to see him.

105
09:47.400 --> 09:48.400
Ah well.

106
09:48.960 --> 09:50.000
I heard

107
09:50.240 --> 09:51.919
there's a comic he drew

108
09:51.920 --> 09:53.319
it's blowing up online lately

109
09:53.320 --> 09:54.360
I'm following it too.

110
09:56.640 --> 09:57.640
Look, look.

111
09:59.280 --> 10:01.280
"The Animals' First Glance"?

112
10:03.440 --> 10:05.280
Kind of a strange title.

113
10:06.000 --> 10:07.280
Sounds like teen angst.

114
10:09.800 --> 10:11.640
When animals are born

115
10:12.080 --> 10:14.120
most of them bond with

116
10:14.400 --> 10:16.520
the first creature their eyes land on.

117
10:18.720 --> 10:18.960
Oh.

118
10:19.120 --> 10:20.320
So that's what it means.

119
10:20.800 --> 10:22.359
What's the comic about?

120
10:22.360 --> 10:24.280
You... you'd better not read it.

121
10:24.520 --> 10:26.280
This comic

122
10:26.720 --> 10:28.520
isn't really for someone your age.

123
10:29.440 --> 10:31.039
It's my son's.

124
10:31.040 --> 10:32.120
So why can't I read it?

125
10:33.720 --> 10:35.080
Hmm...

126
10:36.120 --> 10:39.800
It'd be like a mother sneaking a look at her son's diary.

127
10:39.920 --> 10:40.920
Way too awkward.

128
10:41.920 --> 10:42.920
All right then.

129
10:44.800 --> 10:45.800
Oh right.

130
10:46.480 --> 10:48.719
Song Yi messaged me.

131
10:48.720 --> 10:50.480
He said he's back in Singapore.

132
10:52.000 --> 10:53.680
Why is he only going back now?

133
10:53.840 --> 10:55.720
He said he was in Europe before that.

134
10:56.800 --> 10:57.840
Europe?

135
11:09.663 --> 11:11.336
"The Animals' First Glance"

136
12:46.149 --> 12:47.823
[Banner for the Feiyu fan meeting]

137
13:35.200 --> 13:36.240
Song Yi!

138
13:42.720 --> 13:44.079
You came all this way

139
13:44.080 --> 13:45.080
so why not come in?

140
13:45.240 --> 13:46.360
Scared to face me?

141
13:49.400 --> 13:51.000
I just thought you'd be busy.

142
13:52.520 --> 13:54.879
You only got back to Singapore two days ago

143
13:54.880 --> 13:56.200
and today you're already here.

144
13:56.640 --> 13:58.720
Aren't you going to see Mr. Song?

145
13:58.960 --> 13:59.960
I did.

146
14:00.440 --> 14:01.920
But after seeing him

147
14:02.160 --> 14:03.359
I torched his art studio.

148
14:03.360 --> 14:04.360
What?

149
14:04.400 --> 14:05.680
Are you insane?

150
14:07.280 --> 14:08.280
Ah, come on...

151
14:08.720 --> 14:09.720
Senior

152
14:10.320 --> 14:10.960
got any food?

153
14:11.160 --> 14:12.080
I'm starving.

154
14:12.080 --> 14:13.080
No!

155
14:14.239 --> 14:14.799
Speak.

156
14:15.000 --> 14:17.440
What brought you back this time?

157
14:17.680 --> 14:18.879
No straight answer,

158
14:18.880 --> 14:19.880
no food for you.

159
14:21.840 --> 14:23.320
No reason at all.

160
14:23.520 --> 14:24.920
Just came back to visit.

161
14:27.520 --> 14:29.159
The more you clam up,

162
14:29.160 --> 14:30.720
the more suspicious you look.

163
14:32.660 --> 14:33.660
Talk.

164
14:37.440 --> 14:38.919
If you won't talk,

165
14:38.920 --> 14:40.560
you're getting nothing from me.

166
14:58.920 --> 15:00.840
I found that biology professor.

167
15:04.320 --> 15:05.320
Liang Huan.
